    "problem": "The paper addresses the challenge of understanding the Great Ocean Conveyor's true complexity, as the popular \"conveyor belt\" logo obscures the intricate mixing, driving mechanisms, and critical sensitivity to freshwater fluxes that govern its stability and have profound impacts on global climate.",
    "method": "This paper presents the \u201cGreat Ocean Conveyor\u201d as a conceptual model, synthesizing oceanographic and climate data to explain how thermohaline circulation, driven by water vapor transport, regulates global heat distribution and causes abrupt climate changes.",
    "task": "The task is to provide a summary of the Great Ocean Conveyor's operation, detailing its path, flux, salt-driven mechanism, and its critical role in controlling past and present climate, particularly in the North Atlantic region.",
